    "body": "Yeah, probably - as I said, I did that as part of the initial refactor and only then figured that it's not the only place where numbers are already decoded without definition. In out streaming tokenizer, that's kind of things I really do on each digit and not via shared function on the final number, as it needs to support streaming with as little buffering as possible, but I agree that it might be too excessive to describe that behavior as part of the spec, hence decided to ask.\n\nOkay, reverting then.\n",
