    "created_at": "2016-04-27T18:23:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-27T18:23:38Z",
    "body": "Code points _are_ numbers (integers), by definition, so adding or subtracting integers from them to get other code points is completely well-defined and reasonable.\n",
