    "updated_at": "2016-04-27T18:24:09Z",
    "body": "> My knee-jerk reaction is that a code point and a \"number\" might be different types which could make it a bit confusing to say to subtract a number from a code point and use the resulting code point as a number. \n\nWe already describe lowercasing of uppercase characters that way :)\n",
