    "updated_at": "2016-04-28T08:43:24Z",
    "body": "The prose for lowercasing is indeed similar, but also different in that in that case the result is still a \"code point\" whereas here we want the \"number\" (if they are of different types in some impls). But I'm fine with having the spec assume that they are of the same type.\n",
